<ol class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">Use this system for your boarding-house account, payment submissions, receipts, and reminders.</li>
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">Keep your password private. Never share passwords, PINs, or one-time codes in a note or message.</li>
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">Enter correct payment details. The admin may review your payment, receipt, and message to check your submission.</li>
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">A payment stays pending until the admin approves it. Only approved payments update your confirmed payment status.</li>
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">A partial payment leaves a balance. That balance may be added to your next billing period.</li>
    <li class="rounded-xl bg-[#f4f7ef] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5f756c]">Use clear and respectful messages. Contact the admin if you need help or see an incorrect payment record.</li>
</ol>
